#. type: Content of: <important><para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/security-updates.xml:7
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package has historically had frequent updates that address security "
"vulnerabilities.  To determine the latest status check the <ulink "
"url=\"https://rivendell.linuxfromscratch.org/advisories/\"> Linux From "
"Scratch Security Advisories</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote historicamente tem tido atualizações frequentes que endereçam "
"vulnerabilidades de segurança. Para determinar a situação mais recente, "
"verifique os <ulink "
"url=\"https://rivendell.linuxfromscratch.org/advisories/\">Avisos de "
"Segurança do Linux From Scratch</ulink>."
